rem Diophantine Reciprocals I
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=108
rem Find the least n for which 1/x + 1/y
rem = 1/n has more than a target number
rem of solutions

use sequences
use io
use cli

option Target integer = 1000

Answer = Target least_n
Answer print

rem Solutions number (d(n^2) + 1) / 2,
rem and d(n^2) is the product of 2e + 1
rem over the prime exponents e of n. The
rem least n for a divisor count uses the
rem smallest primes, exponents never
rem increasing.
fun Target least_n
  Need = Target * 2 - 1
  Ps = primes take 16 array
  Best = Ps reduce *
  Ignore = 0 60 1 1 search
  return Best

  fun Idx Top N Count search
    if Count greater Need
      Best = Best N min
      return 0
    end
    if Idx equal 16
      return 0
    end
    P = Ps Idx
    Pow = N
    for E in 1 to Top
      Pow *= P
      if Pow at least Best
        break
      end
      Next = Idx + 1
      Cnt = Count * (2 * E + 1)
      Ignore = Next E Pow Cnt search
    end
    return 0
  end
end
